# This repo is STATIC class: Cloudflare Pages serves build/ and there is no
# server, no database, and no application secret.
#
# Non-secret build config only. Secrets (CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN) live in
# Infisical, never in this file or the repo.

# Public origin the site is served from. Non-secret.
REACT_APP_SITE_URL=https://cointrack.shrijit.tech

# CoinGecko demo key. IMPORTANT: this value is INLINED INTO THE BROWSER BUNDLE
# by the create-react-app build. It must never hold a secret. Leave it unset
# (anonymous CoinGecko access) unless you accept that it is public.
# COINGECKO_API_KEY=